Z||000000||FAXKID||08-25-2001||04:50 PM||||My check engine light has been on for four years now,so today I decided to check out the computer code.I got a 32 and a 42.I guess the 32 means I will need a new egr valve.Does anyone know the cost?Also need to know what a code 42 might mean to my future.||||reg||9
Z||000001||Old Lar||08-25-2001||07:30 PM||||32 Code is EGR system..Could be EGR valve, I think was less than $30, or vaccuum leak, EGR tube cracked $70-$90, or EGR solinoid ~$130.  Check for vaccuum leaks first.  The last time I pulled a 32 code, the vaccuum line came off my solinoid.<P>Code 42.. Electronic Spark Timing  HEI module malfunction may cause this code.  Check all distributor wires.  Changing HEI module may not cure the problem.||||reg||1
